#: docs/user-guide/workflows/package-as-component.md:71
msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-behavior.md:244
msgid "[Your first simulation](first-simulation.md) — tilt the lamp and watch the brightness."
msgstr "[你的第一次仿真](first-simulation.md)——倾斜灯，观察亮度。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:1
msgid "Your first deployment check"
msgstr "你的第一次部署检查"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:3
msgid "**Goal.** Find out whether the lamp from the [first tutorial](first-behavior.md) fits an Arduino Nano — and see what \"does not fit\" looks like."
msgstr "**目标。** 弄清 [第一个教程](first-behavior.md) 中的灯能否放进 Arduino Nano——并看看“放不下”是什么样子。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:6
#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:6
msgid "**Time.** Ten minutes."
msgstr "**用时。** 十分钟。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:8
msgid "This page is the _placement check_: which board pin each physical output's device would use, or why none can. Building the firmware and putting it on a board is the page after — [Your first board](pico-demo.md) — and needs a board this build has firmware for; the Nano here is a placement exercise."
msgstr "本页是 _放置检查_：每个物理输出的设备会用到板子的哪个引脚，或者为什么没有引脚可用。构建固件并把它放到板子上是下一页——[你的第一块板子](pico-demo.md)——那需要一块本版本能生成固件的板子；这里的 Nano 只是放置练习。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:13
msgid "1. Open the Deploy page"
msgstr "1. 打开部署页"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:15
msgid "Click **Deploy** in the page bar (or **⌘3**). On the left, a **Target** pop-up and a **Devices** list; in the middle, the verdict for the chosen board."
msgstr "点击页面栏中的**部署**（或 **⌘3**）。左侧是**目标板**弹出菜单和**设备**列表；中间是所选板子的结论。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:18
msgid "Until you choose a board the page says _Choose a board to see whether this design fits it._"
msgstr "在你选择板子之前，页面显示 _选择一块板子，看这个设计能否放进去。_"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:21
msgid "2. Choose a board"
msgstr "2. 选择板子"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:23
msgid "In **Target**, choose **Arduino Nano**. The verdict reads:"
msgstr "在**目标板**中选择 **Arduino Nano**。结论显示："

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:25
msgid "Fits Arduino Nano so far — the binding is not finished."
msgstr "目前能放进 Arduino Nano——绑定尚未完成。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:27
msgid "and under it: _No device on arduino_nano for: light._ (this line names the board by its short id). The design has an output but nothing says what piece of hardware realises it."
msgstr "其下：_arduino_nano 上没有对应的设备：light。_（这一行用板子的短 id 称呼它）。设计有一个输出，但没有说明哪件硬件实现它。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:31
msgid "3. Add a device"
msgstr "3. 添加设备"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:33
msgid "A **device** is the hardware that realises one output on the board: a PWM channel for a dimmable light, a digital output for a relay, an H-bridge for a motor."
msgstr "**设备**是在板子上实现一个输出的硬件：可调光灯用 PWM 通道，继电器用数字输出，电机用 H 桥。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:37
msgid "Click **Add device**. A row appears in _Devices_."
msgstr "点击**添加设备**。_设备_ 中出现一行。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:38
msgid "Name it `pwmLight`. In its kind pop-up choose **PWM channel**. In its output pop-up choose **light**."
msgstr "命名为 `pwmLight`。在它的种类弹出菜单中选择 **PWM 通道**。在它的输出弹出菜单中选择 **light**。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:41
msgid "The line about `light` disappears and a _Placement on arduino_nano_ table shows the one line the lamp needs: `pwmLight`, its _PWM_ requirement, and the pin it was given, such as `D3`. The verdict stays **Fits Arduino Nano so far — the binding is not finished.**, and one line remains under it: _tilt has no device on Arduino Nano._ The lamp's output is placed; its Source is not."
msgstr "关于 `light` 的那一行消失了，_在 arduino_nano 上的放置_ 表格显示这盏灯需要的唯一一行：`pwmLight`、它的 _PWM_ 需求，以及分配给它的引脚，例如 `D3`。结论仍是**目前可放入 Arduino Nano——绑定尚未完成。**，下面还留着一行：_tilt 在 Arduino Nano 上没有设备。_ 灯的输出已放置；它的来源还没有。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:47
msgid "**What you made.** A deployment configuration for one board. It lives in the project with the design, but it is a separate layer: the Design page's verdicts did not change when you added the device, and they will not change if you pick another board."
msgstr "**你做了什么。** 一块板子的部署配置。它和设计一起保存在项目中，但是独立的一层：添加设备时设计页的结论没有变，换另一块板子它们也不会变。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:52
msgid "**About `tilt`.** A [Source](../concepts/relationships.md) is a value the environment provides, and on a board a device has to provide it — the same kind of binding as for an output, chosen in the device's pop-up (_tilt — Source_) with a **Provider** instead of a Realization. The providers this build has read a digital line as on/off; `tilt` is an angle, so nothing fits it yet, and the deployment honestly stays _not finished_. That is a state, not an error: the design simulates, and the placement of `light` is real."
msgstr "**关于 `tilt`。** [来源](../concepts/relationships.md)是环境提供的值，在板子上必须由一个设备来提供它——与输出同一种绑定，在设备的弹出菜单中选择（_tilt — 来源_），用**提供方式**代替实现方式。本版本的提供方式把数字线读为开/关；`tilt` 是角度，所以目前没有匹配的，部署也就诚实地停在 _尚未完成_。这是一种状态，不是错误：设计可以仿真，`light` 的放置是真实的。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:62
#: docs/user-guide/studio/deploy.md:13
msgid "_The Deploy page: Arduino Nano chosen, one PWM device on light, the placement, and the Source still to provide._"
msgstr "_部署页：选择了 Arduino Nano，light 上有一个 PWM 设备，放置结果，以及尚待提供的来源。_"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:65
msgid "4. Make it fail on purpose"
msgstr "4. 故意让它失败"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:67
msgid "Each device row has one pin field per requirement. In `pwmLight`'s pin field type `D4` — a pin that cannot do PWM on the Nano."
msgstr "每个设备行的每个需求都有一个引脚栏。在 `pwmLight` 的引脚栏输入 `D4`——Nano 上一个不能做 PWM 的引脚。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:70
msgid "Not feasible on Arduino Nano."
msgstr "无法部署到 Arduino Nano。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:73
msgid " D4 cannot carry pwmLight PWM on arduino_nano. The pin chosen by hand, D4, cannot carry pwmLight PWM here."
msgstr " 在 arduino_nano 上 D4 无法承载 pwmLight 的 PWM。手动选择的引脚 D4 在这里无法承载 pwmLight 的 PWM。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:75
msgid "Clear the field: it fits again. Now switch **Target** to **Big board (mock)**: it fits there too, on a different pin. Switch back."
msgstr "清空该字段：又可以放入了。现在把**目标板**切换到 **Big board (mock)**：在那里也能放入，只是引脚不同。切换回来。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:78
msgid "**What happened.** Feasibility is a fact about _this design on this board_. The board choice is a session preference — it is not saved with the project — and the placement is recomputed for whatever board is chosen."
msgstr "**发生了什么。** 可部署性是关于 _这个设计在这块板子上_ 的事实。板子的选择是会话偏好——不随项目保存——布置会针对所选的任何板子重新计算。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:84
msgid "_Not feasible: the pin chosen by hand cannot carry PWM._"
msgstr "_无法部署：手动选择的引脚无法承载 PWM。_"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:86
msgid "What \"feasible\" means, and does not"
msgstr "“可部署”意味着什么，不意味着什么"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:88
msgid "_Feasible_ means every device's requirements can be placed on distinct pins with the right capabilities. It does not mean the circuit will work electrically: current, voltage and timing resolution are not modelled. When several placements are possible the tool shows one; when none is, it shows the first dead end it hit, which is _a_ conflict, not necessarily the only one."
msgstr "_可部署_ 意味着每个设备的需求都能放到具备相应能力的、互不相同的引脚上。它不意味着电路在电气上能工作：电流、电压和时序分辨率没有建模。当有多种布置可能时，工具显示其中一种；当一种都没有时，它显示遇到的第一个死路，那是 _一个_ 冲突，不一定是唯一的。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:96
msgid "**The status line still says _not causal_ or _outputs incomplete_.** The Deploy verdict is only about the board; the design itself is not ready. Fix it on the Design page first. See [Deployment](../troubleshooting/deployment-errors.md)."
msgstr "**状态行仍然显示 _存在瞬时环路_ 或 _输出未完成_。** 部署结论只关乎板子；设计本身还没准备好。先在设计页修好它。见 [部署](../troubleshooting/deployment-errors.md)。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:100
msgid "**Not connected to an output or Source: …** — a device with nothing chosen in its pop-up."
msgstr "**未连接到输出或来源：…**——弹出菜单中什么也没选的设备。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:102
msgid "**… has no device on Arduino Nano.** — a Source no device provides; the deployment stays _not finished_ until one does."
msgstr "**… 在 Arduino Nano 上没有设备。**——没有任何设备提供的来源；在有设备提供之前，部署停在 _尚未完成_。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:104
msgid "**Nothing on Arduino Nano can carry …** — the board has no free pin with that capability; try another kind of device, another board, or fewer devices."
msgstr "**Arduino Nano 上没有东西能承载 …**——板子上没有具备该能力的空闲引脚；试试另一种设备、另一块板子，或更少的设备。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-deployment.md:109
msgid "You have built, simulated and placed a behavior. With a Raspberry Pi Pico at hand, [Your first board](pico-demo.md) builds a design and runs it. Or read the [Concepts](../concepts/concepts.md) pages for the ideas you used, or go straight to [From sensor to output](../workflows/sensor-to-output.md) to extend the lamp with an ambient-light sensor."
msgstr "你已经搭建、仿真并放置了一个行为。手边有 Raspberry Pi Pico 的话，[你的第一块板子](pico-demo.md)会构建一个设计并让它运行起来。也可以阅读[概念](../concepts/concepts.md)各页了解你用到的想法，或直接前往[从传感器到输出](../workflows/sensor-to-output.md)，给灯加一个环境光传感器。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:1
msgid "Your first simulation"
msgstr "你的第一次仿真"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:3
msgid "**Goal.** Tilt the lamp from the [first tutorial](first-behavior.md) and watch its brightness, one tick at a time."
msgstr "**目标。** 倾斜 [第一个教程](first-behavior.md) 中的灯，一拍一拍地观察它的亮度。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:8
msgid "1. Open the Simulate page"
msgstr "1. 打开仿真页"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:10
msgid "Click **Simulate** in the page bar at the bottom (or press **⌘2**)."
msgstr "点击底部页面栏中的**仿真**（或按 **⌘2**）。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:12
msgid "The page has three parts:"
msgstr "这个页面有三个部分："

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:14
msgid "**Sources**, on the left — one control for every value the environment provides. Here that is `tilt`, with a number field and the unit `rad` beside it. Under the Sources, **Timing domains** lists `interaction` with a period: _every 1_ tick."
msgstr "左侧的**来源**——每个由环境提供的值一个控件。这里是 `tilt`，一个数字栏，旁边是单位 `rad`。来源下方，**时序域**列出了 `interaction` 及其周期：_每 1_ 拍。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:18
msgid "the **trace**, in the middle — a table that fills as you step: one row per tick, a column for every computed value and every driven output. Above it, **Step**, **Step ×10** and **Reset**, and the tick counter."
msgstr "中间的**轨迹**——随你步进而填充的表格：每拍一行，每个计算值和每个被驱动的输出一列。上方是**步进**、**步进 ×10** 和**重置**，以及拍计数器。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:21
msgid "the **Probe**, on the right — the value of whatever is selected, now and over the run."
msgstr "右侧的**探针**——当前选中对象的值，包括现在的值和整个运行中的值。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:24
msgid "Nothing runs until you step. If anything in the design would stop a step, it is listed above the trace as a sentence about the object — _tilt needs a value before simulation can step._ — with a _Show_ link that selects it. Step is disabled while such a line is there."
msgstr "在你步进之前什么都不会运行。如果设计中有任何东西会阻止步进，它会在轨迹上方以一句关于该对象的话列出——_tilt 需要一个值仿真才能步进。_——并附有一个 _显示_ 链接来选中它。只要有这样一行，步进就被禁用。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:29
msgid "2. Give the tilt a value"
msgstr "2. 给倾角一个值"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:31
msgid "In the `tilt` field enter `0.7854` (45°; the field takes the base unit shown beside it — radians for an angle)."
msgstr "在 `tilt` 栏输入 `0.7854`（45°；该栏使用旁边显示的基本单位——角度用弧度）。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:34
msgid "3. Step"
msgstr "3. 步进"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:36
msgid "Click **Step**."
msgstr "点击**步进**。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:38
msgid "The trace gains its first row: tick 0, the active domain _interaction_, the Source as the evaluator read it — `tilt` as `Tilt(0.785398 [rad])` — and the values the design computed — `brightness` as `Brightness(0.5)` (or within a few digits of it, depending on what you typed), and the _light_ column showing the same value, because `brightness` drives it. A value is always written with the concept it belongs to. Click **Step** twice more: three rows, the same values, because the Source has not changed."
msgstr "轨迹得到第一行：第 0 拍，活动域 _interaction_，求值器读到的来源——`tilt` 为 `Tilt(0.785398 [rad])`——以及设计计算出的值——`brightness` 为 `Brightness(0.5)`（或者相差几位小数，取决于你输入的值），_light_ 列显示同样的值，因为 `brightness` 驱动它。值总是和它所属的概念一起书写。再点两次**步进**：三行，同样的值，因为来源没变。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:46
msgid "Change the field to `1.5708` (90°) and **Step**: about `Brightness(1)`. Set `0` and step: `Brightness(0)`. Upright is off; flat is full."
msgstr "把栏改为 `1.5708`（90°）并**步进**：约为 `Brightness(1)`。设为 `0` 再步进：`Brightness(0)`。竖直时熄灭，放平时全亮。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:49
msgid "**What happened.** Each tick, every value in the _interaction_ domain was recomputed from the inputs you supplied. The evaluator that produced these numbers is the one that defines what a BDL design means; the generated code for a device is held to it."
msgstr "**发生了什么。** 每一拍，_interaction_ 域中的每个值都根据你提供的输入重新计算。产生这些数字的求值器就是定义 BDL 设计含义的那个；为设备生成的代码必须与之一致。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:56
#: docs/user-guide/studio/simulate.md:11
msgid "_The Simulate page after three steps with the tilt at 45°: the Sources on the left, the trace in the middle, the probe on the right._"
msgstr "_倾角为 45° 时步进三次后的仿真页：左侧是来源，中间是轨迹，右侧是探针。_"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:59
msgid "4. Look at one value"
msgstr "4. 查看一个值"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:61
msgid "Click the `brightness` column header, or select `brightness` on the Design page and come back. The **Probe** shows its value now and its values over the run, written as in the trace, with the concept's glyph. Open **Explain** under it for the formal detail — the identity number and the run's revision."
msgstr "点击 `brightness` 列标题，或在设计页上选中 `brightness` 再回来。**探针**显示它现在的值和整个运行中的值，写法与轨迹中相同，带有概念的图形符号。展开其下的**解释**可查看形式化细节——标识号和运行的修订号。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:66
msgid "5. Reset and try the rhythm"
msgstr "5. 重置并试试节奏"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:68
msgid "**Reset** returns to tick 0 and keeps your inputs."
msgstr "**重置**回到第 0 拍并保留你的输入。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:70
msgid "Under _Timing domains_, set _interaction_ to _every 2_. **Step ×10**: the _active_ column now names _interaction_ only on every second tick, and `tilt`'s cell is shown only on those ticks — on the others the domain did not activate, so no value was read. A period is a simulation choice; the design itself only says _which_ domain a value belongs to."
msgstr "在 _时序域_ 下，把 _interaction_ 设为 _每 2_。**步进 ×10**：_活动_ 列现在只在每隔一拍时写着 _interaction_，`tilt` 的单元格也只在那些拍显示——其余拍该域没有激活，所以没有读取任何值。周期是仿真的选择；设计本身只说明值属于 _哪个_ 域。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:76
msgid "What a step actually does"
msgstr "一次步进实际做了什么"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:78
msgid "Every step is a replay: the simulator restarts at tick 0 with all the inputs you have entered so far and runs to the new tick. The same design, the same inputs and the same periods give the same trace, every time. Changing the design on the Design page drops the trace; your input values stay."
msgstr "每次步进都是重放：仿真器带着你迄今输入的所有值从第 0 拍重新开始，运行到新的一拍。同样的设计、同样的输入和同样的周期每次都给出同样的轨迹。在设计页上修改设计会丢弃轨迹；你的输入值保留。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:85
msgid "**Step is disabled and a sentence names a relationship.** Read it: a Source without a value, a concept without a value form, a relationship without a valid definition, or relationships that depend on each other in the same instant. Each has a _Show_ link. See [Incomplete design](../troubleshooting/incomplete-design.md)."
msgstr "**步进被禁用，并有一句话指出某个关系。** 读一读：没有值的来源、没有值形式的概念、没有有效定义的关系，或者在同一瞬间相互依赖的关系。每一条都有 _显示_ 链接。见 [未完成的设计](../troubleshooting/incomplete-design.md)。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:90
msgid "**A tick stops with a message on the controls' line** (for example a division by zero). The message names the relationship. Change the formula or the inputs and step again."
msgstr "**某一拍停止，控件行上出现消息**（例如除以零）。消息会指出关系。修改公式或输入，再次步进。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:93
msgid "**The trace is empty after you edited the design.** Expected — the run belongs to one version of the design. Step again."
msgstr "**编辑设计后轨迹为空。** 这是预期的——运行属于设计的某一个版本。再次步进。"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/first-simulation.md:98
msgid "[Your first deployment check](first-deployment.md) — does this lamp fit an Arduino Nano?"
msgstr "[你的第一次部署检查](first-deployment.md)——这盏灯能放进 Arduino Nano 吗？"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/install-and-launch.md:1
msgid "Install and launch"
msgstr "安装与启动"

#: docs/user-guide/getting-started/install-and-launch.md:3
msgid "Behavior Designer is built from source. There is no installer or packaged download yet. The build produces two things: the Studio app and the compiler service it talks to (`bdld`), which Studio starts for you."
msgstr "Behavior Designer 从源码构建。目前还没有安装程序或打包下载。构建会产生两样东西：Studio 应用，以及它所对话的编译器服务（`bdld`），后者由 Studio 替你启动。"

