msgid "**a bar down a block's left edge, an entry arrow, the word _Source_**"
msgstr "**块左边缘的竖线、入口箭头、_来源_ 一词**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/canvas.md:15
msgid "a **Source**: a block with no formula — the environment provides its value. Nothing is missing"
