msgstr "**_有争议_、_格式错误_、_无时序域_ 等词**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/canvas.md:17
msgid "the one state word a node may carry, only while that state holds (an output that must be driven says _required_ meanwhile; a Source says _Source_)"
msgstr "节点可以携带的唯一状态词，只在该状态成立时显示（必须被驱动的输出在此期间显示 _必需_；来源显示 _来源_）"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/canvas.md:18
msgid "**a small name at a node's right edge**"
msgstr "**节点右边缘的小名字**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/canvas.md:18
msgid "its timing domain"
