msgstr "**Esc**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/formula-editor.md:204
msgid "Revert a draft (a second Esc when completion is open closes it first)"
msgstr "还原草稿（补全打开时，第一次 Esc 先关闭它）"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/formula-editor.md:205
msgid "**Return**"
msgstr "**Return**"

