msgstr "**=**、**&**、**\\|**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/formula-editor.md:215
msgid "likewise `==`, `&&` (and), `\\|\\|` (or); `<=`, `>=` and `!=` are in the **Compare** pop-up"
msgstr "同理 `==`、`&&`（and）、`\\|\\|`（or）；`<=`、`>=` 和 `!=` 在**比较**弹出菜单中"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/formula-editor.md:216
msgid "**!**"
msgstr "**!**"

