msgstr "字段"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:16
#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:25
#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:54
msgid "**Meaning**"
msgstr "**含义**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:16
#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:54
msgid "Name, Meaning"
msgstr "名称、含义"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:17
msgid "**Value**"
msgstr "**值**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:17
msgid "Quantity / On / off / Count / Decide later; Unit (a list of quantity kinds, the symbol in its own column)"
msgstr "量 / 开/关 / 计数 / 稍后决定；单位（量的种类列表，符号在单独一列）"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:17
msgid "choosing a value form the first time rechecks nothing; changing a chosen one says which relationships it rechecks"
msgstr "第一次选择值形式不会重新检查任何东西；更改已选的值形式会说明它重新检查哪些关系"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:18
msgid "**Relationships**"
msgstr "**关系**"

