msgid "**Driver**"
msgstr "**驱动方**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:56
msgid "the state (_Driven by brightness._, _Undriven — the design is incomplete without a driver._, …); claimants with _disconnect_; a _Connect_ pop-up of the design's values of the accepted concept, or one sentence when there is none"
msgstr "状态（_由 brightness 驱动。_、_未驱动——没有驱动方设计不完整。_，…）；带 _断开_ 的争夺者；一个列出设计中生成所接受概念的各个值的 _连接_ 弹出菜单，没有时则是一句说明"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:56
msgid "see [Physical outputs](../concepts/physical-outputs.md)"
msgstr "见 [物理输出](../concepts/physical-outputs.md)"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:57
msgid "_Detach … from …_, _Create upstream combination mapping_, _Connect a driver to …_"
msgstr "_把 … 从 … 分离_、_创建上游组合映射_、_为 … 连接驱动方_"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:60
msgid "Timing domain"
msgstr "时序域"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:62
msgid "Timing domains have no inspector page: rename them in place in the sidebar and delete them there while unused. Their meaning is in the relationships and outputs that _update in_ them."
msgstr "时序域没有检查器页面：在侧栏中原地重命名，未使用时也在那里删除。它们的含义体现在 _更新于_ 它们的关系和输出中。"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:66
msgid "Behaviors, components, instances, bindings"
msgstr "行为、组件、实例、绑定"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:68
msgid "They have inspectors of their own; [System projects](system-projects.md) describes them."
msgstr "它们有各自的检查器；[系统项目](system-projects.md) 会描述它们。"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:73
msgid "The disclosure at the end of every inspector. It shows the object's identity number, the formal interface and, for a relationship with a formula, the inferred type and the Core term; the status word; the diagnostic codes and technical text behind each finding; the revision; and the kind of the last change (_refinement_ / _edit_) with what it invalidated. This is the one place in Studio where compiler vocabulary appears. Nothing above it depends on it."
msgstr "每个检查器末尾的展开区。它显示对象的标识号、形式化接口，对于有公式的关系还有推断出的类型和 Core 项；状态词；每个发现项背后的诊断代码和技术文本；修订号；以及最后一次更改的种类（_精化_ / _编辑_）和它使什么失效。这是 Studio 中唯一出现编译器词汇的地方。它上面的内容没有任何东西依赖它。"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:82
msgid "[Workspace](workspace.md) · [Formula editor](formula-editor.md) · [Status meanings](../reference/status-meanings.md)"
msgstr "[工作区](workspace.md) · [公式编辑器](formula-editor.md) · [状态含义](../reference/status-meanings.md)"

