#: docs/user-guide/textual/editor-and-lsp.md:53
msgid "**Formatting**"
msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/textual/editor-and-lsp.md:53
msgid "`textDocument/formatting`"
msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/textual/editor-and-lsp.md:53
msgid "canonical spacing and indentation; keeps item order, blank-line grouping, comments and your line breaks (a multi-line body keeps its relative indentation); a file with a syntax error is left untouched"
