#: docs/user-guide/textual/editor-and-lsp.md:54
msgid "**Inlay hints**"
msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/textual/editor-and-lsp.md:54
msgid "`textDocument/inlayHint`"
msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/textual/editor-and-lsp.md:54
msgid "`: Tilt` after a parameter whose name is not the concept's; `sync interaction → display, init 0` after a binding that crosses domains"
